                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 6. Reimbursement will be contingent upon successful completion of the course (attainment of a grade of \"C\" or better). Employees who terminate employment before the end of a course will not be eligible for reimbursement.",
